Package: agrirf
Title: Random Forest Forecasting for Agricultural Yield Time Series
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Lunganlung", "P. G.", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "lunganlungpg@gmail.com")
Description: Fits Random Forest regression models to agricultural yield time
    series using autoregressive yield lags and agro-climatic predictors
    (rainfall, temperature, solar radiation, NDVI, soil moisture), and ranks
    predictors by permutation importance (%IncMSE). Ships helpers to load the
    35-season sample dataset used in the accompanying Python pipeline.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/agri-rf-forecasting
BugReports: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/agri-rf-forecasting/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    randomForest,
    stats,
    utils
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
